            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "dairymaid303"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It was good but I'm not wild about it, just not my taste I guess. I added some cranberry juice to the mix and liked that much better, helped cut some of the sweetness of the pineapple juice.",
            "datePublished": "2012-03-02T07:15:37.283Z"
