              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Emily"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Something I won't try again.. I made a whole batch for my family, but it didn't really hit it. It just tasted watered down.. so I tried adding more pineapple juice, even some sugar, but the taste stayed just somehow off. I guess, it just wasn't the drink for us!",
